  - m_Id: 3394301962
    m_Localized: Men capture forward only, kings move one step; a man crowned stops there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3394301963
    m_Localized: Men capture backward too, kings fly; a man crowned mid-capture goes on as a king.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3394301964
    m_Localized: 'On a 10x10 board: flying kings, and a capture must take the most pieces it can.'
